Stata file \'93Code for Replication.do\'94 generates tables in manuscript and online appendix. Annotations are provided to explain sections of code and identify table exports. Some tables will export to an Excel file and others will export to RTF for easy Word compatibility. All files will be saved to the working directory defined by the user. Most tables depend on local macros or variables generated in previous sections. Running entire program is recommended to easily replicate results. The user will need to install the \'93ivreg2\'94 and \'93xtivreg2\'94 Stata packages in order to estimate the GMM models.\
\
