R script \'93figure1-code.R\'94 generates Figure 1 in the manuscript. Annotations explain code. Script imports, cleans, and joins two data files: \'93real-property-assessment-and-homestead-exemptions_2018.csv\'94 and \'93county_locale.csv\'94.\
\
 \'93county_hex.csv\'94 contains Kentucky county assessment and homestead exemption information for year 2018. These data were obtained by request from the Kentucky Department of Revenue.\
\
\'93county_locale.csv\'94 contains locale designations based on the National Center for Health Statistics 2013 Urban-Rural classification.\
